==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Kaijin Doge]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*4 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 40~46.67 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,400f</sup>.
*2 [[One Horn]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 33.33~40 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,200f</sup>.
*1 [[Teacher Bear]] spawns after 43.33 seconds<sup>1,300f</sup>.
*3 [[Madam Peng]]s spawn after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>, delay 46.67~53.33 seconds<sup>1,400f~1,600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Spam [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Wall Cats]] with [[Fedora Cat (Special Cat)|Blue Nyanko Rangers]] to win.

